1
00:00:01,671 --> 00:00:03,671
The driver tries to open the door.

2
00:00:04,027 --> 00:00:06,141
The driver's hand blocks the door from closing.

3
00:00:06,587 --> 00:00:08,587
Nathan slams the door on his hand.

4
00:00:09,618 --> 00:00:12,470
The driver opens the door and punches Nathan in the face.

5
00:00:14,204 --> 00:00:17,116
The driver closes the door and draws the curtains.

6
00:00:17,143 --> 00:00:19,143
Nathan puts his hand over his nose.

7
00:00:19,247 --> 00:00:21,247
The driver steps up.

8
00:00:20,583 --> 00:00:22,583
Nathan punches him.

9
00:00:22,859 --> 00:00:25,372
The driver throws him through a wall.

10
00:00:27,945 --> 00:00:31,355
The driver slams him to a wall, then drops Nathan with a left hook.

11
00:00:32,492 --> 00:00:35,846
The driver grabs his neck and smashes Nathan's head into a window.

12
00:00:36,704 --> 00:00:39,817
In the driver's room, Karen kicks a counter from the floor.

13
00:00:40,456 --> 00:00:43,250
The driver grabs Nathan by the neck and lifts him up the wall.

14
00:00:43,538 --> 00:00:45,538
He pinches Nathan's cheek.

15
00:00:50,198 --> 00:00:52,198
Nathan spits on the driver's face.

16
00:00:52,464 --> 00:00:54,818
He closes his eyes and takes off his glasses.

17
00:00:55,317 --> 00:00:57,890
He wipes his face and tosses Nathan to the ground.

18
00:00:58,565 --> 00:01:00,565
He stops his foot, but Nathan avoids it.

19
00:01:01,141 --> 00:01:03,275
The driver lunges on Nathan, choking him.

20
00:01:03,421 --> 00:01:05,421
Karen kicks the counter.

21
00:01:04,937 --> 00:01:06,937
A glass falls and breaks.

22
00:01:09,754 --> 00:01:11,754
Nathan elbows the driver.

23
00:01:11,691 --> 00:01:14,404
He wraps his leg around his head and arm and squeezes.

24
00:01:14,982 --> 00:01:18,712
Karen brings a shard of glass closer to her with her foot.

25
00:01:20,894 --> 00:01:22,894
Nathan punches the driver.

26
00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:24,720
The driver loses consciousness.

27
00:01:24,924 --> 00:01:26,924
Nathan releases his grip.

28
00:01:27,270 --> 00:01:29,385
Karen scoots closer to the broken glass.

29
00:01:34,041 --> 00:01:36,041
Nathan smiles.

30
00:01:35,058 --> 00:01:37,058
The driver stands.

31
00:01:40,366 --> 00:01:42,366
Nathan kicks a gun from the driver's hand.

32
00:01:43,511 --> 00:01:45,645
Nathan punches him and does a flying spin.

33
00:01:45,842 --> 00:01:47,842
The driver stumbles.

34
00:01:47,659 --> 00:01:49,795
Nathan lunges and punches him.

35
00:01:49,742 --> 00:01:51,742
Nathan winces and shakes his hand.

36
00:01:51,866 --> 00:01:53,866
He punches the driver, who lies unconscious.

37
00:01:54,151 --> 00:01:56,151
Nathan steps back.

38
00:01:55,268 --> 00:01:57,268
The window is cracked.

39
00:02:00,356 --> 00:02:02,356
He kicks the window out.

40
00:02:03,207 --> 00:02:05,207
He grabs the driver by his collar.

41
00:02:05,173 --> 00:02:07,173
Karen enters the room.

42
00:02:07,649 --> 00:02:09,684
Nathan throws the driver out of the window.